upply  in osaka  hospitals are overrun with seriously ill  patients  still international olympic committee  officials are championing the games  which are now less than nine weeks away  in this final stretch  our top priority continues to remain  on organizing safe and secure  olympic games for everyone not only do  the president of the ioc speak publicly  but in what can be seen as an effort to  galvanize support  the olympic organization also released  messages from  two high-ranking public figures sport  brings us closer as a global community  and the world of sport has been a beacon  of light  to kaido's fort despite the new u.s  travel warning  american athletes will be heading to  japan  and so will canadians  there are plenty who want the 2020  olympics  canceled including japanese citizens and  local  and foreign public health officials it's  absurd to have the olympics  at the present time i mean if you think  of the two  key features of the olympics they  involve a huge amount of international  travel  and mass gatherings roughly 80 000  people are expected to attend the games  a key to the ioc safety plan is to have  athletes vaccinated  three different vaccine manufacturers  have offered shots  to ensure that can happen crystal  gamansen global news  london  i had goodbye charlie why this lovable  viral video  is being pulled from youtube charlie bit  me  who can forget charlie the finger biter  it's one of the first videos  to go viral which makes this a piece of  internet history  it's been watched more than 880 million  times  but it's not going to be removed from  youtube because the family has  sold it as an nft or non-fungible token  for more than 760 thousand dollars nfts  are a growing trend in the digital art  world it's like a certificate of  authenticity stamped into a blockchain  and it's lucrative for those who own the  viral clips  well you just want to hear more of that  florida's governor wants to stop tech  companies from de-platforming 